Value Required AGG_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value AGG_MODE (\S+)
Value PARTNER_ID (\S+)
Value SELECTED_PORTS (\d+)
Value UNSELECTED_PORTS (\d+)
Value INDIVIDUAL_PORTS (\d+)
Value LOADSHARING_TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${AGG_INTERFACE}\s+${AGG_MODE}\s+${PARTNER_ID}\s+${SELECTED_PORTS}\s+${UNSELECTED_PORTS}\s+${INDIVIDUAL_PORTS}\s+${LOADSHARING_TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record